# The launch site: where its ground crew and its visitors stand, work and walk - game space
# (x east, y up, z south), from the pad's centre. Read by the NPC engine after the pavilion's
# office.nav (src/npc: World::add_site); the last link joins the two.
# The apron's top is 0.35 above the ground round it and ends 70 m out. The tower stands north of
# the mount (z -19.5 .. -9.5), the tank farm south-west, the control house 88 m west, the
# pavilion's steps 72 m north.
# spot: kind, place, yaw (0 = toward -z, + turns toward +x), and what is looked at from there.
#
